  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.3: Draw API cleanup and additions. Added Draw.Vertices, Draw.Polyline and Draw.ConvexPolygon for drawing prebuilt VertexArrays, polylines and convex polygons. Replaced the per-radius/per-size shape caches in Draw with single shared shape instances, removing an unbounded-growth memory leak on animated shapes. Removed the redundant generic Draw.Circle/Rectangle/Triangle/Line<T> overloads; FluentDraw.DrawSelf is now the single adapter from ZGeometry primitives to Draw. Reworked DrawOptions application to avoid per-call delegate allocations and fixed Opacity being applied to a stale fill color. Fixed several Component lifecycle bugs: OnStart no longer overwrites a manually-set Name, Destroy no longer calls OnClose multiple times on nested children, and IsActive is now respected for Update/FixedUpdate/Render/DebugRender at every level of the component tree.",
